<https://www.idee.es/csw-codsi-idee/srv/api/records/spaignPNOA2021> a dcat:Dataset ;
    dcatap:applicableLegislation <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2008/1205>,
        <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj> ;
